<title>CANADA: Extendicare Inc Q3 shr profit rises.</title>
<headline>Extendicare Inc Q3 shr profit rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>TORONTO, Nov 13 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.25		   C$0.22</p>
<p> Net			 20,287		   17,044</p>
<p> Revs		     377,319		  343,170</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.76		   C$0.70</p>
<p> Net			 59,939		   52,329</p>
<p> Revs		   1,110,794		1,015,722</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Above per share results are fully diluted. Basic earnings per share</p>
<p>were C$0.26 in the third quarter of 1996 compared to C$0.23 in the third quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
